{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b1a136628e5b4a63","name":"Icy Ground","source":{"id":"source:reference-b1a136628e5b4a63","title":"Icy Ground","revision":21348,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:38:06Z","sha256":"f3551c1debdcb1b2b745d6ab4829d51fc4191c02d1b6f0c67e708b1689dcd1ec","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21348","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Icy%20Ground&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b1a136628e5b4a63","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["The slick surface of the ice makes any movement a gamble."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Attacks made by this Hazard can be avoided if the target is using equipment that grants better traction on icy surfaces. Spiked footwear, for example, provides a hero with the means to keep his or her balance on slippery surfaces and to avoid the Hazard's attack. Heroes riding in a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," that does not touch the ground are not affected by the Hazard's attack.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Icy Ground Statistics (CL 2)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Keywords:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Artificial"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Artificial"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Natural"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Natural"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Trigger:"]}," A being or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wheeled Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wheeled_Vehicle"}," moves into the Icy Ground.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Attack:"]}," +4 vs ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 2d10\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Recurrence:"]}," On Trigger\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"},":"]}," The following are suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," for this Hazard:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jump"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jump","referenceId":"reference:9ee0ca3e24d60ea0"}," (DC 19):"]}," The character leaps over the ice, gaining a +5 circumstance bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," to avoid the Hazard."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," (DC 14):"]}," When operating a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wheeled Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wheeled_Vehicle"},", the character maintains control of the vehicle even if the Hazard's attack is successful."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," (DC 24):"]}," Using the same technique used for moving silently, the character can ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move","referenceId":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c"}," at half ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," and is not affected by the Hazard's attack."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," Immediately after the Hazard's successful attack, the target is knocked ",{"tag":"a","children":["Prone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Prone","referenceId":"reference:4d99dff1fb964110"},", ending its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move","referenceId":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c"}," Action. The target must spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"}," to stand up. As the target attempts to regain its footing, the Hazard makes an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity"}," against the target with a -5 penalty. If the attack is successful, the target slips on the ice and falls ",{"tag":"a","children":["Prone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Prone","referenceId":"reference:4d99dff1fb964110"}," again, but it takes no extra damage.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
